OL,3,GNEWSAHopes church clock will chime once
OL,4,Amore
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have come together to raise
OL,7,Fhundreds of pounds to fix their local
OL,8,Fclock, which has been described as
OL,9,F"part of the fabric" of the their town.
OL,11,FUntil the end of 2025, hourly chimes
OL,12,Fwould ring out from Holy Trinity Church
OL,13,Facross Bradford-on-Avon in Wiltshire.
OL,15,FChristopher Segar, the church warden at
OL,16,FHoly Trinity, said the clock, which is
OL,17,Fcurrently out of action, was "part of
OL,18,Fthe fabric of the of the centre of the
OL,19,Ftown" but that it had been "silent for
OL,20,Fsome months".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
